# armour/shared/pauldron_winged5_l: the great WINGED pauldron on the left shoulder (winged.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a winged guard grown great: two feather points sweep up and out over the shoulder, the outer 3 (legend 4) px
# over its top, a dark rib running down from the notch between them; a seam and a lame under it (the TALL mass).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the lame's lip, G the glint, N the seam, P the lit feathers.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron winged.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

